There and Back — Isometric Infographic explainer (7 s, 1920×1080, 24 fps)

All picture is drawn in code (Canvas 2D). No generated, photographic or stock imagery.
- engine.js: isometric engine from the Lemo-Opuscar style library (github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar), MIT licence.

Font
- Jost (Owen Earl / indestructible type*), SIL Open Font License 1.1 — fonts/Jost.ttf, licence fonts/Jost-OFL.txt
  (source: github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/jost)

Music and sound
- Original score and all foley/ambience synthesised in mix.py (numpy/scipy), using helpers from the
  library's core/audio/sfx.py (MIT). No samples or recordings.
